  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.18\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- Publish the emulator libraries to NuGet (#29) (`68acafb`)\n- Rename to Zafiro.GameBoy.Debug (#28) (`ea01489`)\n- fix: set ContentRootPath to AppContext.BaseDirectory to avoid recursive inotify watches (`eb874eb`)\n- fix: honor observability review contracts (`8c82e24`)\n- feat: add deterministic Game Boy observability (`f2350b4`)\n- docs: document Codex MCP tool discovery (`bafa4ee`)\n- feat: add advanced debugging workflows (`a3e28ca`)\n- feat: add memory watchpoints and step-over / step-out (#8) (#19) (`f87acc9`)\n- perf: avoid per-instruction register formatting in continue_until_break (#18) (`b2a1fe7`)\n- docs: complete third-party license attribution and bundle notices (#17) (`a34c6d6`)\n- fix: mark GameBoy.Debug.Emulator as non-packable (#16) (`c34368d`)\n- feat: replace native SameBoy bridge with a pure-managed cross-platform core (#15) (`1c057b9`)\n- feat: distribute as GameBoy.Mcp .NET tool via DotnetDeployer (#14) (`80bae46`)\n- feat: add SameBoy savestate support (#13) (`df1b1b2`)\n- fix: evaluate breakpoint conditions (#12) (`63df184`)\n- feat: return inline PNG screen captures (#11) (`ea03c37`)\n- feat: add session introspection tools (#10) (`9aa2e1b`)\n- feat: add sameboy joypad mcp tools (`4718e76`)\n- feat: add game boy debug mcp (`5d156e8`)\n",
